kalinka-plugin-sdk (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release of Kalinka Plugin SDK
  * Provides APIs and base classes for Kalinka Player plugins
  * Supports input modules and external device plugins
  * Installation into /opt/kalinka/venv for integration with Kalinka Player

